WEBVTT

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.410
You won't be able to drive
if you drink too much.

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:36.350
I'll be fine by morning.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.780
I've booked us a room.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:44.780
M-Mitaka?!

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:49.600
If not tonight, I'll
book a room tomorrow night

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.550
And the next night,
and the next.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:59.380
Until you open up
your heart to me,

00:02:00.610 --> 00:02:02.410
I'll continue to book a room.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.030
She's late...

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:28.130
Where is Kyoko?

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.350
I won't let her
go home tonight.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.280
If Mitaka is serious, there's
no point in waiting here...

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:43.040
Yusaku, how long do you
plan to wait here?

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:46.970
Grandma, please watch
these kids. I have to go.

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:49.010
Go where?

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:50.850
Wh-Where? Well...

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:54.130
Kyoko?

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:58.620
Hi.

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:00.690
Mr. Chigusa?

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:05.500
I need to have a talk
with Kyoko. I'm going in.

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:08.440
Manager's not home yet

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:11.660
What?!

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.570
I think she's with Mitaka.

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:21.250
What's the big deal?
It's only 9:30.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.460
How dare he drag around
my daughter

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:27.190
until so late in the night!

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:35.370
Kyoko, Dad's coming
to rescue you!

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.940
Let's hurry, Dad.

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:43.190
"Dad"?

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.780
What's going on?

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:12.210
Mitaka, you're
making me uncomfortable.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.730
I know what I'm doing
is unreasonable.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.410
You're joking, aren't you?

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.450
What do you think this is?

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:25.540
It's the key to our room.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:29.350
All I need now is.

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:36.830
...a key that will
open up your heart.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:41.200
Or must I wrench it open?

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:50.410
I'm sorry, Mitaka, I...

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:07.780
What do I say? Being evasive
won't work anymore.

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.550
Mitaka.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.030
Why don't we get
some fresh air?

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:25.840
Please.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.220
No one's home.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:44.200
You know where else
he might be?

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.030
I don't know.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.280
No?!

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.140
Let's look where
Mitaka might go.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.600
It's no use waiting here.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:04.540
Mitaka.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:11.460
For what?
You're not a child.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:14.280
I have a feeling everyone's
worried about me.

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:17.850
Are you going to
have Godai come again?

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:19.590
Bulls-eye?

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.330
No! I wouldn't do that.

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:26.300
Of course not.
It's about you and me.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.350
All right, all right.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:42.890
Maison Ikkoku.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.540
Hi, Manager.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:49.780
Mrs. Ichinose, I'm still out.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.100
Sure. Take your time.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:58.570
Was there an urgent
message for me?

00:06:59.010 --> 00:06:59.790
No.

00:07:04.280 --> 00:07:05.870
What about Godai?

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:07.710
Godai?

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:13.240
It seems he's stepped out.
You need him?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.660
No. Bye.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:18.410
What was that all about?

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:22.990
Where are you
at a time like this?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.720
Maybe he's out
looking for me.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:30.770
But where?

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:53.980
Can't you think
of somewhere?

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.490
Sir! Don't smoke here, please.

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:02.770
Sorry.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:03.720
I know!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:05.660
Somewhere that reeks!

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:07.800
"Reeks"?

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:10.370
Yes. Like a place with
a nice night view.

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.800
A classy bar in the sky.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.580
A park with a harbor view.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.970
Right. Those places sure reek.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:16.670
Let's go.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.450
Hurry! Hurry!

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:36.760
What a nice breeze.

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.080
Are you warm enough?

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:46.610
Yes, but do you feel
less tipsy now?

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:07.570
Are you trying to think of
a way to turn me down

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.720
without hurting me?

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:17.320
No matter how you do it,
it'll be cruel.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:21.350
Cruel.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:33.640
I'm sorry.

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:41.020
I'm sorry. I know apologizing
isn't going to fix anything,

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:45.520
but I'm so indecisive, and.

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:50.640
I'm sorry it's gotten
to this point.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.870
But I...

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:01.270
I-

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.380
Please don't cry.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:22.950
If only I can embrace
your heart like this.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:28.420
I'm sorry.

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:31.970
I'll cancel tonight.

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:49.630
I'm sorry I can't
drive you home.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:53.340
It huts me too much
to look at you.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:14.320
I wonder where
the manager could be?

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.830
It's almost dawn.
I'm exhausted.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:21.920
Why don't we head back?

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.230
I'll keep looking
Just a little longer.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:37.130
Why do you want
to find her so badly?

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:45.050
Maybe you'll get mad
at me for saying this.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:54.010
but I want to marry Kyoko.

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:17.180
Hello? Mr. Chigusa?

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:58.490
If only I can embrace
your heart like this...

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.000
I wonder where Godai is?

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.480
Calm down, Mr. Chigusa.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:22.960
Shut up! She stayed out
all night with a man!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.490
I'm going to slap her face!

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:28.140
No violence!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.690
Besides, Manager is not
that kind of a woman.

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:34.100
You can't tell me that
a grown man and a woman

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:38.800
stayed out all night
and nothing happened!

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:42.130
And the guy she was out with
is that Mitaka!

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:44.260
I just know
something happened!!

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:46.210
I...

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.470
I trust the manager!

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:54.450
Godai?

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:02.460
Dad? Why are you here?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.480
Why?!

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.430
Mr. Chigusa, please calm down
and have a talk.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:08.300
Did you hear
what she said?

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.730
We were looking
for her all night!!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.970
Listen, Kyoko.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:18.450
I'm sorry to
have worried you.

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:22.970
well...

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:24.350
Nothing...

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.480
happened, right?

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:30.430
What do you mean?

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:34.330
You know, well...

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:41.300
Anyway, I trust you.
See you.

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.840
I better go home
and get some shut-eye!

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:57.640
Were you with
my father all night?

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.690
Y-Yes. He's
an interesting man.

00:15:02.020 --> 00:15:03.580
I'm sorry.

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.150
N-No problem.

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:09.590
Um... About what time
did you get home?

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:14.390
It must have been
around 2:00 a.m.

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:17.330
It was later
than I expected.

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:21.310
I see.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.640
I know you were worried.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.740
I just thought
something happened,

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.350
since you were so late.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:36.290
A-And by "something,"
I don't mean, you know.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:41.140
A-Anyway, it doesn't
Concern me.

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:43.750
I'm going to sleep a little.

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:45.390
Wait.

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.440
I'm glad you're home safe.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:53.300
G-Godai?

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.640
You're obviously very concerned.

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:13.690
She was out with Mitaka

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.790
and came home at a
questionable time.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.430
2:00 a.m...

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.280
What?!

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:10.850
Taro?

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:23.350
Taro?

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:24.860
Chief!

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.190
It's warm today.

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.630
I'm sure your mama
will be here today.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:41.320
I had a dream last night
that she'd be back.

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:44.680
Then I know
it'll come true.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:51.300
Does Kasumi realize what
it takes to be a mother?

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.650
Her kids are trusting
her to come back.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:47.480
It's rather quiet today.

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:51.350
They're all still sleeping.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:55.410
They were partying at
Yotsuya's place last night.

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:56.950
I see.

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:07.890
Chief, cheer up.
I know Mama will come back.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.600
I'm sorry. I'm not
worried about your mama.

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:17.340
I envy your mama, Taro.
You trust her.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:22.350
I trusted you, too, Manager.

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:25.590
But now you don't?

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.680
That's not what I said.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.590
I know you think
something happened.

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:31.620
Like what?

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:37.030
I went to a hotel with
Mitaka last night.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:54.250
had some wine at the lounge,
saw the ocean,

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.040
and that was it.

00:19:56.560 --> 00:19:59.520
Nothing like what
you're imagining happened.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:01.910
I'm telling you the truth.

00:20:05.860 --> 00:20:07.650
So, um..

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:18.390
I'm sorry. That wasn't
a nice way to say it.

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:24.280
It's okay. I believed in
you from the beginning.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:27.670
"Believe, and thou
shalt be saved," right?

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:31.100
Liar. You had
no faith in me.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:32.610
Chief.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:35.820
Mama's late.

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:40.110
Y-You're right

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:48.590
What'll we do in case
she doesn't show?

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:52.600
In case? I'm sure
she'll come back.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.270
But.

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:57.960
Taro!

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:03.310
Taro!

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:11.680
That's right.
Kasumi has a pager.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:25.190
The party you have just
dialed is being paged.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.440
Please hang up and
wait for your call.

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:53.730
Taro.

00:21:53.980 --> 00:21:55.000
Don't cry, Taro.

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:57.730
If she doesn't come,
I'll take care of you.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:02.310
Don't worry.
Your mother will be back.

00:22:13.950 --> 00:22:15.290
K-Kasumi?!

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:19.050
Taro, what's the matter?

00:22:19.360 --> 00:22:20.120
Mama!

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:26.360
Boys don't cry.

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:28.630
Since when
were you upstairs?

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:31.350
Since last night.

00:22:31.640 --> 00:22:35.550
I didn't want to wake the kids,
so I was partying next door,

00:22:35.610 --> 00:22:37.010
and then I fell asleep.

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:38.130
Dear me!

00:22:39.450 --> 00:22:40.910
You must be the manager!

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:45.090
Thank you for
taking care of my kids.

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:48.990
Y-You're welcome.
Nice to meet you.

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:55.390
Isn't it great, Taro?

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:57.830
You too, Hanako.

00:22:58.340 --> 00:23:00.000
Were you worried, Taro?

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:05.770
Of course he would be.
She was late.

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:10.780
But you trust your mama,
right, Taro?

00:23:18.850 --> 00:23:25.990
Manager, things like this
must wear you down.

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.330
No problem.

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:37.120
She's the manager,
and I'm Just the tenant.

00:23:38.310 --> 00:23:40.000
So, uh.

00:23:49.450 --> 00:23:51.550
Godai and Coach Mitaka's
gonna have a duel?!

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:52.910
That idiot

00:23:53.190 --> 00:23:55.210
He's got final exams
starting tomorrow.

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:59.680
They've got to declare a clear
winner sometime, anyway.

00:23:59.840 --> 00:24:04.460
Next: "The Main Event!
Godai and Mitaka's Fight-to-End-All-Fights"

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:06.860
I won't let you have Kyoko!
